  "prefLabel": "Plc 1001.20 Fees for Review of Candidate Supervision Agreements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1001.20 Fees for Review of Candidate Supervision Agreements. The fee for board review of a candidate for licensure agreement, including supervision agreements, where such approval is required by applicable law, shall be $25 for a one-year agreement and $50 for a 2-year agreement.\n\nSource. #14289, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1000.html"
